# purpose: part A of the M4 replay pair. Two successful transfers happen here, so after the restart
#          the next tag must be t3 - a transfer counter that restarts emits t1 twice.
# exercises: journal + replay of transfer facts, on top of everything from the m3 pair.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob USD
OPEN carol EUR
DEPOSIT alice 100
DEPOSIT bob 50
DEPOSIT carol 75
TRANSFER alice bob 30
TRANSFER bob alice 5
TRANSFER alice carol 1
FREEZE carol
WITHDRAW bob 0.5
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
